# Hands: the colour tool. Chosen from the actions wheel ("Select Color Tool"), it paints the block the right hand points at
# with the right trigger and takes up that block's colour with the left trigger.
# World: Earth Planet (survival, on foot, in gravity). A large armor block is built ahead as the thing to paint. The angle of
# the "Select Color Tool" entry below is for Earth Planet's 19 entries (it is the fifth, 4 x 18.9 = 75.8 degrees clockwise
# from up): the "Actions wheel: opened" line lists the entries in order.

plugin SpaceEngineersVR
world game:Earth Planet

# ---- What the world needs: a block to paint, and a build colour that is not the block's own ----------------------------------------

admin creativeTools
# out of the starter base, where nothing is built within 10 m, to build there
goto open
# the block is built in the selected colour, which the game keeps from world to world: first one unlike the paint
color 0.1 0.5 0.5
build LargeBlockArmorBlock 2.2 as Test block
goto Test block 2.2
color 0.6 0.3 0.2
log SpaceEngineersVR.log
expect session focused within 60

head 0 1.6 0
hand left -0.25 1.2 -0.3
hand right 0.2 1.3 -0.3 -17 -4 0
wait 1
# Before: the block's colour, remembered.
read nearby LargeBlockArmorBlock 5
mark

# ---- The actions wheel: Select Color Tool ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

press left grip
wait 1
press left stick
wait 0.2
release left stick
wait 1
stick left 0.969 0.245
wait 0.7
release left grip
wait 0.3
stick left 0 0
wait 1.5
expect log Actions wheel: picked Select Color Tool within 5
expect log Colour tool on within 5

# ---- The right trigger paints the block pointed at --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

press right trigger
wait 0.5
release right trigger
wait 1.5
expect log Paint: within 5
read nearby LargeBlockArmorBlock 5
expect 0.colorMask moved > 0.01

# ---- The left trigger takes up the colour of the block pointed at -------------------------------------------------------------------------

press left trigger
wait 0.5
release left trigger
wait 1
expect log Paint: took the colour of the block pointed at within 5
expect no log Exception
